<title>SOUTH AFRICA: POLL - S.African economic indicators consensus.</title>
<headline>POLL - S.African economic indicators consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>There are no major South African economic indicators scheduled for release next week.</p>
<p>Latest trade, money supply, private sector credit, consumer inflation and gross domestic product data will all be released in the week of August 25, officials said on Friday.</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
